Backport of grpc/grpc#36743 (cd074cc0b55f554cc2f7d336c2d02dd69783ae4a).
https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/36743

Keep an extra transport reference across SetupTransport and start_reading.
Use the concrete grpc_chttp2_transport reference-counted type because the
gRPC 1.61.3 Transport interface does not provide Ref().

